      "body": "## What does this PR do?\n\nAdvance both package versions on `main` for the next development cycle:\n\n- Megatron Core: `0.20.0` → `0.21.0`.\n- Megatron FSDP: `0.7.0rc0` → `0.8.0rc0`.\n\nPreserve the existing patch versions and prerelease suffixes. The Core metadata file also receives the blank-line adjustment required by the current Black formatter.\n\n## Issue tracking\n\nFollows the two-package update pattern in #6120. Includes the Core-only version bump proposed in #8191.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `uv sync --locked --only-group linting`.\n- `BASE_REF=main CHECK_ONLY=true SKIP_DOCS=false uv run --no-sync bash tools/autoformat.sh`: Black, isort, pylint, and Ruff passed.\n- Standalone mypy check passed for both metadata files.\n- Loaded both metadata files and verified their version tuples, short versions, and rendered package versions.\n- `git diff --check`.\n",
